@page "/"

<PageTitle>ReadMe</PageTitle>

<h1>About Page</h1>

<h3>This program is a networked snake game.</h3>
<h4>To use it do the following.</h4>
<ol>
    <li>Enter your name into the textbox and hit ENTER.</li>
    <li>Click Connect. If there is a problem connecting to the server, an error message will pop up. Ensure the server is connected and click Connect again.</li>
    <li>Use the wasd keys to turn your snake.</li>
    <li>The color of the snake is based on the users ID. After applying a modulo to the ID the color is based on the result. The user can disconnect and reconnect to get a different color.</li>
    <li>Collect powerups to increase your score and grow your snake.</li>
    <li>If you run into an obstacle (a wall or another player) your score and length will reset.</li>
    <li>Click disconnect if you want to stop playing.</li>
</ol>
<h4>Note</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Once you've connected, you should not navigate away from the snake page without disconnecting.</li>
    <li>Click on the database tab to view the scores. It is best if opened in a new tab.</li>
    <li>Once on the databse page, you need to refresh the page in order to see updated scores in real time.</li>
    <li>If running in Visual Studio, both GUI and WebServer should be selected as startup projects.</li>
</ul>



